# 📘 Percentage (प्रतिशत)

### परिभाषा (Definition)

किसी संख्या को 100 के अंश के रूप में व्यक्त करना **प्रतिशत** कहलाता है।
👉 "Per" = प्रति, "Cent" = 100

---

## Formulas (सूत्र)

1. Percentage = (Part ÷ Whole) × 100
2. Value = (Percentage × Whole) ÷ 100
3. Whole = (Part × 100) ÷ Percentage

---

## Important Fractions & Percentages

* 1% = 1/100
* 5% = 1/20
* 10% = 1/10
* 12.5% = 1/8
* 20% = 1/5
* 25% = 1/4
* 50% = 1/2
* 75% = 3/4
* 100% = 1

---

## Types of Questions

### 1. Simple Percentage

किसी संख्या का 20% = 50 → संख्या = (50×100)/20 = 250

### 2. Increase/Decrease

मूल्य ₹500 से ₹600 → वृद्धि = 100 → (100/500)×100 = 20%

### 3. Population (Base find करना)

120% = 36,000 → Base = (36,000×100)/120 = 30,000

### 4. Successive Change

Formula = A + B + (AB/100)
उदाहरण: +20% और –10% → 20 – 10 + (20×–10)/100 = 8% वृद्धि

### 5. Exam Marks

750 = 60% → कुल अंक = (750×100)/60 = 1250

### 6. Profit & Loss

CP = 500, Profit 20% → SP = 500 + 100 = 600

### 7. Population Growth (Successive)

Net % = 10 + 20 + (10×20)/100 = 32%
50,000 × 1.32 = 66,000

---

## Short Tricks

* x% of y = y% of x
  👉 20% of 50 = 50% of 20 = 10

* Successive Change हमेशा formula से निकालें।

* Fraction Conversion याद रखें, Calculation आसान होगी।

